    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis beautifully positioned second-floor two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment at Granitefield Manor offers bright, spacious and well-proportioned accommodation in a highly sought-after location on Rochestown Avenue. The apartment benefits from impressive floor-to-ceiling windows, creating a wonderful sense of light and space while taking full advantage of the views towards the Dublin Mountains. With the added benefit of evening sunshine, this is a particularly appealing home for those looking to enjoy a bright and relaxing living environment throughout the day.\n\nThe accommodation comprises two generous bedrooms, with the principal bedroom featuring a master ensuite, providing excellent privacy and convenience. The open, light-filled feel of the property makes it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, downsizers, professionals or those seeking a superb investment opportunity. The combination of generous living space, two bathrooms and stunning outlooks makes this apartment a particularly attractive proposition.\n\nThe location is equally impressive. With a bus stop right on your doorstep, commuting and access to surrounding areas could not be more convenient. Killiney Shopping Centre is just\na two-minute stroll away, offering a supermarket, pub, restaurants and cafés for all your everyday needs and leisure requirements. The apartment is also only a short distance from\nDún Laoghaire, with its picturesque harbour, coastal walks, restaurants, cafés and vibrant town centre. Granitefield Manor therefore offers the perfect blend of convenience, connectivity and quality of life in one of South Dublin's most desirable areas.\n\nKey Features\nSecond-floor 2 bedroom, 2 bathroom apartment\nBright and spacious accommodation\nManagement Fees 2,917.79 (2026)\nImpressive floor-to-ceiling windows\nBeautiful views towards the Dublin Mountains\nEnjoys evening sunshine\nMaster bedroom ensuite\nBus stop at your doorstep\n2-minute stroll to Killiney Shopping Centre\nSupermarket, pub, restaurants and cafés nearby\nShort distance to Dún Laoghaire\nExcellent transport links and highly convenient location"
      },
